QA5 M4. Two deferred closures: one sets the named result if it is nil, the
other wraps it. The function's own fmt.Errorf is applied once, and is not
nested in itself. The closure that wraps what it reads lists its values under
its Wrap as chain may repeat, as before. (Run time: ErrClose, or ErrGet under
"f" under "d2".)
